  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6208.01 Mailing Lists. The division shall charge a $15.00 fee to obtain the New Hampshire fire department mailing list.\n\nSource. #7552, INTERIM, eff 9-5-01, EXPIRED: 3-4-02\n\nNew. #7747, eff 8-17-02; ss by #9496, eff 6-26-09; ss by #12477, eff 2-8-18 (formerly Saf-C 6207.01)",
